{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Additional production occurrence\n\nAt `origin/main` commit `ae4030bd4a920762e27971f59a7aafdc4fcc0026`, `rebar review-plan immolated-holohedral-waterdogs` failed before model execution while other sessions were using the shared tracker.\n\n### Exact stderr\n\n```text\nError: git fetch from 'origin' failed (attested mode fails closed): error: cannot lock ref 'refs/remotes/origin/tickets': is at 85e049ab2715b3fd5aeac586658ac859a44b7224 but expected 65efa1967a9b0c54ee7c2182c1593954f3896ab2\n```\n\nA serialized `git fetch origin` followed by the same review command completed with a signed PASS. This result matches the parallel and serialized distinction established by this bug. No duplicate bug was created."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787528528665943001,"uuid":"21016a11-2480-4048-bfad-d2a8e72972b3"}